Additional Notice (Non-binding Request)

This architecture includes several structural concepts such as synchronized 
client-side in-memory databases, isomorphic interfaces for mixed sync/async 
CRUD operations, and unified abstract UI state management.

If you reference, adapt, or implement any of these architectural ideas or 
design patterns in your own projects, I would appreciate it if you could 
consider acknowledging this repository as a source of inspiration. I would 
also be very happy to hear about your use case if you are willing to share it.

This notice is a non-binding request and does not modify the permissions 
granted by the MIT License.
